# Bombur, Gentle Dreamer (CR 502.3, 702.195b): "Bombur doesn't untap during your untap step unless you have an enduring
# story." Bombur is Bot1's only permanent that is an artifact, Saga or legendary; it attacks on turn seven and is still
# tapped on turn nine. That turn Bot1 casts Mox Pearl and Mox Jet, the second and third, and has the story, so Bombur
# untaps in turn eleven's untap step.

